5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need a logical way to handle the shortage. I'll look into ""Morning departures watched from the entrance"" and ""Rain exposure along the parking rows"" to understand the actual physical conditions of the area.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
